Exemple

--
Clone the Repository

Bash 

git clone [https://github.com/mrisacoliver/financial-ledger-engine.git](https://github.com/mrisacoliver/financial-ledger-engine.git)
cd financial-ledger-engine

--------------

Start Infrastructure via Docker Compose
Start PostgreSQL, Redis, Kafka, and Zookeeper:

docker compose up -d

--------------------------

Run Application

./mvnw spring-boot:run

--------------------------------


Testing
Run unit, integration, and domain validation tests:

./mvnw clean test

----------------------------------------

